# Scheduling encouragement only: the delay does not prove either worker
# entered recv's condition wait before close. The channel API exposes no
# waiter-state witness; blocked-wait coverage remains an acceptance gap.
ch is channel of 1
define wait() as:
    return recv of ch
a is spawn of wait
b is spawn of wait
usleep of 1000
close_channel of ch
thread_join of a
thread_join of b
